# 跨平台（Linux / Windows / macOS）统一换行符。
# 本文件的优先级高于每台机器上的 core.autocrlf，所以不需要再要求每个人去改本地 git 配置。
# 策略：仓库内一律存 LF，检出到任何平台也写 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 脚本类必须 LF：一旦被 Windows 写成 CRLF，WSL / Linux / macOS 下执行会报 bad interpreter
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：禁止任何换行符转换，同时跳过 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.bmp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.har binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.mp4 binary
*.p12 binary
*.p7b binary
*.cer binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary

# .cer 是 PEM 文本证书（不是 DER），要按文本处理才能和仓库里已有的 LF 版本保持一致
*.cer text eol=lf

# 签名 material 是无扩展名的二进制数据
client/signature/**/material/** binary
